    {
      "name": "Cleanup",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Cleanup: Delete all test users",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const projectRef = pm.environment.get('supabase_project_ref');",
                  "const serviceRoleKey = pm.environment.get('service_role_key');",
                  "const ids = pm.environment.get('created_user_ids');",
                  "",
                  "if (!ids) {",
                  "  console.log('Không có user nào cần cleanup.');",
                  "  return;",
                  "}",
                  "",
                  "if (!projectRef || !serviceRoleKey) {",
                  "  console.warn('Cần set supabase_project_ref và service_role_key trong environment.');",
                  "  return;",
                  "}",
                  "",
                  "const baseUrl = projectRef.replace(/\\/$/, '');",
                  "const userIds = ids.split(',').filter(id => id);",
                  "const deletedIds = [];",
                  "const failedIds = [];",
                  "let completed = 0;",
                  "",
                  "userIds.forEach((userId, index) => {",
                  "  const deleteUrl = baseUrl + '/auth/v1/admin/users/' + encodeURIComponent(userId);",
                  "  pm.sendRequest({",
                  "    url: deleteUrl,",
                  "    method: 'DELETE',",
                  "    header: {",
                  "      'apikey': serviceRoleKey,",
                  "      'Authorization': 'Bearer ' + serviceRoleKey",
                  "    }",
                  "  }, function (err, res) {",
                  "    completed++;",
                  "    if (err || res.code >= 400) {",
                  "      failedIds.push(userId);",
                  "      console.warn('Xóa thất bại: ' + userId + ' - ' + (err ? err.message : res.code));",
                  "    } else {",
                  "      deletedIds.push(userId);",
                  "      console.log('Đã xóa: ' + userId);",
                  "    }",
                  "",
                  "    if (completed === userIds.length) {",
                  "      const summary = 'Cleanup: ' + deletedIds.length + '/' + userIds.length + ' users deleted' + (failedIds.length ? ', failed: ' + failedIds.length : '');",
                  "      pm.test(summary, () => {",
                  "        pm.expect(deletedIds.length).to.eql(userIds.length);",
                  "      });",
                  "      pm.environment.set('created_user_ids', '');",
                  "      console.log(summary);",
                  "    }",
                  "  });",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/health",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "health"]
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "description": "Xóa tất cả test users đã tạo trong session.\n\nSet 2 biến trong environment (Current Value):\n- `supabase_project_ref`: Ví dụ `https://xyzabc.supabase.co`\n- `service_role_key`: Service role key từ Supabase Dashboard → Settings → API\n\nChạy request, nó sẽ loop qua từng user ID và gọi DELETE qua Supabase Admin API.\n\nNếu chưa set 2 biến trên, có thể chạy SQL script thủ công:\n```sql\nDELETE FROM auth.users WHERE email LIKE 'tenant-%@test.com' OR email LIKE 'ep%@test.com' OR email LIKE 'reset-%@test.com' OR email LIKE 'landlord-%@test.com' OR email LIKE 'bva-%@test.com';\n```"
    }
  ],
